 :itonami.blueprint/implemented-slice
 "ResinAdvisor ⊣ Primary Forms Plant Operations Governor, langgraph-clj
 StateGraph, append-only audit ledger. A plant OPERATIONS COORDINATION
 actor for plastics-and-synthetic-rubber PRIMARY FORMS manufacturing
 (polymerization/compounding reactors producing resin pellets/
 granules/latex) -- an upstream chemical-process plant, distinct from
 downstream molding/extrusion/finished-product actors -- not direct
 reactor/polymerization-line-equipment control authority. Four ops
 (`:log-production-batch` / `:schedule-maintenance` /
 `:flag-safety-concern` / `:coordinate-shipment`), all `:effect
 :propose` only. Ten concrete governor checks elaborate this
 blueprint's four HARD invariants: propose-only effect, closed op
 allowlist, closed proposal-effect allowlist (no direct reactor/
 polymerization-line-equipment control), permanent reactor-actuate
 block, independent equipment verification/registration before
 maintenance scheduling, independent batch verification/registration
 before shipment coordination, independent shipment-weight recompute
 against the batch's own logged weight, double-schedule guard,
 polymer-grade validation, and off-spec-rate plausibility validation.
 Safety-concern flagging (chemical-hazard/monomer-exposure/exothermic-
 reaction-risk/equipment-safety) ALWAYS escalates to a human plant
 supervisor; `:log-production-batch` is the only op eligible to
 auto-commit, and only at phase 3 when governor-clean."}
